@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title Provisionamento Multinuvem — padrões GoF

interface CloudFactory <<Abstract Factory>> {
  +createVirtualMachine(n:int): VirtualMachine
  +createObjectStorage(n:int): ObjectStorage
  +createMessageQueue(n:int): MessageQueue
  +getProviderName(): String
  +getVmHourlyCost(): double
  +getStorageCostPerGb(): double
  +getQueueMonthlyCost(): double
}
interface VirtualMachine <<Abstract Product>> {
  +getHourlyCost(): double
}
interface ObjectStorage <<Abstract Product>> {
  +getCostPerGb(): double
}
interface MessageQueue <<Abstract Product>>
interface Resource {
  +getId(): String
  +getProvider(): String
  +getMonthlyCost(): double
}
Resource <|-- VirtualMachine
Resource <|-- ObjectStorage
Resource <|-- MessageQueue

class AwsFactory <<Concrete Factory>>
class AzureFactory <<Concrete Factory>>
CloudFactory <|.. AwsFactory
CloudFactory <|.. AzureFactory

class AwsVirtualMachine <<Concrete Product>>
class AwsObjectStorage <<Concrete Product>>
class AwsMessageQueue <<Concrete Product>>
class AzureVirtualMachine <<Concrete Product>>
class AzureObjectStorage <<Concrete Product>>
class AzureMessageQueue <<Concrete Product>>
VirtualMachine <|.. AwsVirtualMachine
ObjectStorage <|.. AwsObjectStorage
MessageQueue <|.. AwsMessageQueue
VirtualMachine <|.. AzureVirtualMachine
ObjectStorage <|.. AzureObjectStorage
MessageQueue <|.. AzureMessageQueue
AwsFactory ..> AwsVirtualMachine : cria
AwsFactory ..> AwsObjectStorage : cria
AwsFactory ..> AwsMessageQueue : cria
AzureFactory ..> AzureVirtualMachine : cria
AzureFactory ..> AzureObjectStorage : cria
AzureFactory ..> AzureMessageQueue : cria

class EnvironmentProvisioner <<Director / Builder>> {
  -factory: CloudFactory
  +provision(request): Environment
}
EnvironmentProvisioner --> CloudFactory
class EnvironmentRequest <<Value Object>> {
  -name: String
  -provider: String
  -vmCount: int
  -storageGb: int
}
class BudgetExceededException <<Exception>>
RuntimeException <|-- BudgetExceededException
class Environment <<Product>> {
  -name: String
  -provider: String
  -region: String
  -monthlyCost: double
  +printSummary(): void
}
EnvironmentProvisioner ..> EnvironmentRequest : usa
Main ..> EnvironmentRequest : cria
EnvironmentProvisioner ..> Environment
Environment o-- "1..*" VirtualMachine
Environment o-- "1" ObjectStorage
Environment o-- "1" MessageQueue

class AppConfig <<Singleton>> {
  -region: String
  -monthlyBudget: double
  -AppConfig()
  +getInstance(): AppConfig
}
class AuditLog <<Thread-safe Singleton>> {
  -records: List<AuditRecord>
  -nextSequence: long
  -AuditLog()
  +getInstance(): AuditLog
  +register(...): void
  +printAll(): void
}
class AuditRecord <<Entity>> {
  -sequence: long
  -dateTime: LocalDateTime
  -environment: String
  -provider: String
  -result: String
}
class Main <<Composition Root / Provider Selector>>
Main ..> AwsFactory : seleciona
Main ..> AzureFactory : seleciona
Main ..> EnvironmentProvisioner
Main ..> AuditLog
EnvironmentProvisioner ..> AppConfig
EnvironmentProvisioner ..> BudgetExceededException
AuditLog o-- "*" AuditRecord

note right of CloudFactory
Abstract Factory garante uma família
de produtos do mesmo provedor.
end note
note right of AppConfig
Singleton Holder: carrega config
uma única vez.
end note
note right of AuditLog
Singleton + synchronized:
registro atômico e ordenado por sequência.
end note
@enduml
